{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_title", "source_sha256": "c5427b958c6ad846b97c3263126e5a3a302eaa7ada43f0f9afebc88e7a2019f4", "ja": "Last Episode.追憶", "zh": "Last Episode.追忆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_synopsis", "source_sha256": "58334e69163fba104af7cf5c44f37c25d712ab818d751a22ccf5ffe54798147b", "ja": "特務機関ネメシスとの決着の後、\nそれぞれの思いを抱きながら\n日常を過ごしている、\nヒーロー達の一幕です。", "zh": "与特务机构Nemesis决战过后，\n英雄们带着各自的思绪，\n回到了日常轨道上。\n这便是其中的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "cb0161c14807b1680e6c25ee336c5dec62a77f493366d8b65a9aec46baad2c9e", "ja": "特務機関ネメシスとの戦いが終わり、\n私たちの世界に、束の間の平和が戻ってきました。", "zh": "与特务机构Nemesis的战斗告终，\n我们的世界恢复了短暂的和平。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "0cc154e2195ca74a4b0b4438937e86991926885ee29ea25b17b0e2ec8c72bb83", "ja": "依然デストルドーが活動を続ける中、私たちは戦いと、\n壊された町の復興に大忙しの毎日です。", "zh": "死欲尚未停止活动，我们每天都忙着战斗，\n还有重建遭到破坏的城市。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "41a92fea642e94a379a08e09bcb47b52506aefdac378cca386fed981bb49ca63", "ja": "ねえ、百合子！　あっちの瓦礫どうする？\n片付けるにしても、置いておく場所が……百合子？", "zh": "欸，百合子！那边的瓦砾该怎么办？\n就算想清掉，也找不到地方放……百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "52d0b211a3375e961bffc98f271c9f9839dc32c6f421d0d75b29461c73ac315f", "ja": "百合子ちゃん？\n……おーい！　百合子ちゃんってば～！", "zh": "百合子？\n……喂──！我说百合子啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "78adb5911a2c2a73cbc4ab22376e4218bb04d06b2a0016d28930251904ba42b9", "ja": "えっ？　あ、ごめんね、ふたりとも！\nえっと、何の話だっけ？", "zh": "咦？啊，两位抱歉！\n那个，你们刚刚说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "d87a096cf7362a0266d6396d4cc88cd915e53fde827de1c715d37ca3b1ec71a3", "ja": "百合子、もしかして疲れてる？　わかった！\nここは私と翼でやるから、休んでていいよ！", "zh": "百合子，你是不是累了？好！\n这里就交给我和翼，你去休息吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "64869879435b9f190e2fd211b68665ea923a017ff337554c7f9ef7d594f3aebe", "ja": "わたし達、ネメシスが来てからずっと働きっぱなし\nだもんね～。早く終わらせてカフェとか行きたいな～。", "zh": "毕竟自从Nemesis来了以后，我们就没休息过了～\n好想赶快弄完，去咖啡厅坐坐哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "a171da15808b15793eea4701f93f391e4c1d82d6f2f48d68359fa3258c0d5a24", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫！　疲れたとかじゃなくて。\nただ……こんなに壊されちゃったんだなぁって。", "zh": "没关系，不要紧的！我没有觉得累，\n只是……在感叹城市被破坏得这么严重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "5cf23cd16b160478b6588a6023555acb6b0ecf32642051af229f9c8e125829fd", "ja": "私にもっと力があれば……\n守れたのかな……。", "zh": "如果自己能更强大的话……\n或许就能守住了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "67cedfa0ec7076784cc9af822723fe0b75a8c648f35047c7cb2460802f16b26f", "ja": "百合子……。", "zh": "百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3d92c55fbae26961a8680b6fa192dd502f43132788c31319bf742d70e6c0e190", "ja": "別に、そんなことないと思うけどな。\n百合子ちゃんも海美さんも、がんばってたし。", "zh": "我是不这么认为啦，\n百合子和海美都已经那么拚命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "91f6b203a5cec49396790a5fdce659bcd9e7be5004967d8acf5204df3dbea7a5", "ja": "わたし達は、がんばったよ。誰かが戦わなかったら、\nもっと大勢の人が困っちゃってたはずだしね。", "zh": "我们尽力了，如果当时没人挺身而出，\n现在肯定会有更多的人在伤脑筋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "7263535919dfac67ea7f7fff71330f1cc70154f7c1480c9a322331c5c52c4c9b", "ja": "そうだよ、百合子！\nヘコんでるヒマなんか、ないないっ！", "zh": "就是说啊，百合子！\n现在才没工夫让你在这边消沉呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "a5ced01b01be9d163b4aeb48f844f8c3fafb4c827efceb427ff1be42587ba7af", "ja": "うん……そうだね！　落ち込んでるヒマがあるなら、\nもっと強くならないとだよね。", "zh": "嗯……说得也是！与其消沉，\n不如利用时间让自己变得更强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "3bb4a5a71090a3e49e35bfb1d881541a346d2cae84ccc3b5720f4cc4927a6d84", "ja": "おーい、マイティセーラーズ！\nそろそろ交代の時間だぜ。", "zh": "喂──！『Mighty Sailors』！\n差不多要换班啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e1867479253398df12da02f4da0e6d43d80180322e6b8b944d8cc471e32caa0e", "ja": "あっ、ジュリアーノだ♪\nやっほ～！", "zh": "啊，是茱莉亚诺♪\n哈啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "b62f6936a99d9bd05f795323fb449887892e7d8a84eb293edc339631ec937a7d", "ja": "あれ、ジュリアだけ？\nキャットはまだ入院中だけど、紬は……。", "zh": "奇怪，茱莉亚你一个人吗？\n猫咪是还在住院，但䌷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "a44f9f9499cdc6237f918a6e6f5318a0ee757dde54741fe7736a5d0ca200bb13", "ja": "ああ、ちょっとヤボ用でな。しかし、\nこの何日かでだいぶ片付いたな～。さすがヒーローズ！", "zh": "啊，她有点事情啦。不过，\n这几天下来也清理得差不多了呢～真不愧是英雄联盟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "bc487afa0236e71eab633eedbc5dd6ad94af3b54173630fefe505ce1cf72aac9", "ja": "あずささんも莉緒ねぇも、もう仕事に復帰してるしね。\nあとは……。", "zh": "阿梓姊和莉绪大姊也都回到工作岗位上了，\n现在只剩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "02ea673fe867366ebb46d8a801d96f64c53977299ceee8a03d30d44528182ed5", "ja": "そうだな。あとは……。", "zh": "是啊，只剩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1020_null", "source_sha256": "6d32eb470e4e69958ae5a6de17cd6043c78cf7b23757b6973cabd68d5642fc61", "ja": "ピーッ、ザザッ", "zh": "哔──！滋滋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1021_null", "source_sha256": "6c6312cb7279cb104e5cf9d917b7225bb5ff59dee8aa102d6c61174f0298e072", "ja": "『付近で活動中の全ヒーローに通達！　市内に\nデストル怪人が出現、至急現場に急行してください！』", "zh": "『通告正在附近活动的所有英雄！\n市区出现死欲怪人，请立刻赶往现场！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "9913d9abf121f5ec0e0e8de90defc4c67503a4f32a5fffdf18c184e9117ae177", "ja": "くそっ、性懲りもなくまた……！\n百合子、海美、翼！　行くぞ！", "zh": "可恶，真是学不会教训……！\n百合子、海美、翼！我们走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1026_se", "source_sha256": "b1b74518ac7c0956a5861546d869874497ad9d5c6443c27d74e0ec7c2f4a70f9", "ja": "ザザーン……ザザーン……。", "zh": "唰……唰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ec0c15a1bc2d7b7c6c95079cd40e755224e5d76f4f082eba06b59db98fa0d9fa", "ja": "姉さん……。", "zh": "姊姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "5b865d422028db759cbc794dfbaddb51103fd26cb29ba990d2db4373b099950b", "ja": "……………………。\nありがとう、……紬……。", "zh": "……………………\n谢谢你……䌷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "bdbc4ff005fb42aafd2ef12e233254b3a4a205c40b7efe9bb8f190ef80c278d2", "ja": "泣かないで、紬……あなたのせいじゃない。\n辛い役目を負わせて、ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "䌷，你别哭……这不是你的错。\n对不起，让你承担这么艰辛的任务……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "c3bf0a92139a6683da34d563fe8e6585fc005e6bd2e81a933910971626c15607", "ja": "紬……あなたなら、きっと……。\n……本当の……ヒーロー、に…………。", "zh": "䌷……我相信你一定……\n……可以成为……真正的、英雄…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c49d21d3391fc8865365499bf6b8e87349e4dcabb02aca9ca941e6d1e636a525", "ja": "姉さん？　……姉さん！？\n目を開けて、姉さん！", "zh": "姊姊？……姊姊！？\n睁开眼睛啊，姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "475ae63a87cc5629e88944582122d23c0e3b86d7752fee494552ee49f76cfff9", "ja": "う、うぅ……！\nうわああああぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁーっ！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……！\n唔哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2fdf19cce387f4303ba863e431668432d6efa4e4725788b052c9ad3e8f8f3119", "ja": "（自分の中に、デストルドー因子があること。\n姉さんが一番、怖かったはずなのに……）", "zh": "（自己的体内有着死欲因子这件事，\n姊姊明明比谁都更害怕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_10_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "809e8808249bf7e9658085012e6c57513717dcd30716796ab8fa6fe89602ddbc", "ja": "（それでも姉さんは、戦い続けた。この街を……\n世界を。私たちを、守るために）", "zh": "（但她还是一直奋战，为了守护这座城市……\n为了守护世界、守护我们。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
